      en: "The Royal Palace of Fez (Dar el-Makhzen) is located in the Fez el-Jdid district and is famous for its seven massive brass doors. Although the palace complex is closed to visitors, the majestic facade adorned with zellige tiles and carved wood is a popular photo subject."
