      en: ["Founded: 13th century (Marinid dynasty)", "Complex area: Approximately 80 hectares", "Main feature: Seven golden brass gates", "Location: Fès el-Jdid district", "Role: Active residence for the King of Morocco", "Entrance square: Place des Alaouites"],
